// The marble bust cast in crystal (Poly Haven marble_bust_01, CC0): its signed-distance grid as
// half floats, zlib-compressed and base64-encoded, and the folded normal as a base64 PNG. Both
// ship inside this script because a page opened from a plain file can run a script but can
